        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ઈમાન",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઈમાન — īmān — \"integrity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "સાચો માણસ પૈસા માટે પોતાનું ઈમાન વેચતો નથી. sāco māṇas paisā māṭe potānũ īmān vecto nathī. An honest person does not sell his integrity for money."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A neuter noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઈમાન (īmān) is usually traced to Arabic īmān, \"faith\", through Persian; in Gujarati it is the faith one keeps with others."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for giving reasons and opinions."
